abstract: >-
  MSc Business Analytics capstone for West Dean Estate. A validated spatial
  decision-support tool that identifies plantable land, matches species to soil
  using Ecological Site Classification, quantifies carbon with the UK Woodland
  Carbon Code v3.0 methodology (reproducing a certified project to within one
  tonne of CO2e) and prices the resulting Pending Issuance Units.
